@startuml 支付序列图

actor 消费者 as User
participant 小程序 as MiniApp
participant "后端服务" as Server
participant Redis as Redis
participant 微信支付 as WeChat
participant 数据库 as DB

User -> MiniApp: 点击"去支付"
MiniApp -> Server: POST /api/orders (创建订单)
Server -> Redis: 尝试扣减 SKU 库存\n(原子操作)
Redis --> Server: 扣减成功
Server -> DB: INSERT order + order_items
DB --> Server: 订单创建成功
Server -> WeChat: 统一下单 API
note right: 传入订单号、金额、openid
WeChat --> Server: 返回 prepay_id
Server --> MiniApp: 返回支付参数\n(prepay_id, sign, ...)
MiniApp -> WeChat: 唤起微信支付弹窗\n(参数签名)
User -> MiniApp: 输入密码/指纹确认
MiniApp -> WeChat: 发起支付
WeChat -> WeChat: 验证签名、扣款
WeChat --> MiniApp: 支付结果
MiniApp -> Server: 支付结果页跳转

alt 支付成功回调
  WeChat -> Server: POST /api/orders/wx-notify
  note right: 幂等处理\n(微信支付单号防重)
  Server -> DB: 更新订单状态 → 已支付
  Server --> WeChat: 返回 SUCCESS
end

alt 支付失败/未支付
  Server -> Server: 30分钟超时检查
  Server -> Redis: 释放库存
  Server -> DB: 订单状态 → 已取消
end

@enduml
